    "text": "IT is hereby notified under Regulation 30 of the Wages Boards Regulations, 1971 that Ms. Geetha Anoma Yasanayakehave been appointed as Employee's Representatives of the Wages Board for the Retail & Wholesale Trade in place of Mrs.Poornima Maheshi Anandasiri by the Hon. Minister of Labour and Labour Relations under Section 9 of the Wages BoardsOrdinance (Chapter 136). This appointment is valid since 2018.07.01 to 2020.11.30",
